{
  "sn44.9:2.1": "nānātitthiya → nānātitthiyānaṃ samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṃ paribbājikānaṃ (machasaṃ); aññatitthiyānaṃ samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṃ paribbājakānaṃ (syā)",
