  "sn44.9:3.4": "kaccāyano → pakudho (PTS)",
  "sn44.9:4.7": "vivattayi → vāvattayi (aññatra)",
  "sn44.9:4.9": "kathannāma → kathañhi nāma (syā, PTS)",
